codex
Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on the paper’s multihomogeneous Buchberger framework ([paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1105.5509)).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `medium`, `n=36`, `GF(65537)`
- All G1–G9 gating checks pass
- Bare oracle: `easy` solved 2/3; `medium` solved 0/3
- Reference Gauss–Jordan: 9,666 operations
- Structural route: 214 operations
- Guessing: 0/200,000
- Answer size: 501 characters, 72 elements
- Structural-hint arm: 0/3
- Placebo arm: unavailable because OpenRouter exhausted its total-key limit; error transcript retained honestly

Deliverables:

- [gen_1105_5509.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1105.5509/gen_1105_5509.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1105.5509/selftest_report.json)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1105.5509/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
